; vera_molnar_des_ordres.tscn — a standing canvas of near-black squares whose
; deviation from the orthogonal grows outward from the centre, with a horizontal
; VR slider on the rail below driving max_rotation from 0 to 25 degrees and
; regenerating the field in place. All geometry procedural in the .gd; the
; composition math is ported from commons/primitives/puzzles/rotation_match_puzzle.gd.

